由\(\angle BFC=90^\circ\)，有\[0=\overrightarrow{FB}\cdot\overrightarrow{FC}
=\left(-\dfrac{\sqrt3}{2}a-c\right)\left(\dfrac{\sqrt3}{2}a-c\right)+\dfrac{b^2}{4}
=c^2-\dfrac{3a^2}{4}+\dfrac{b^2}{4}\]代入\(b^2=a^2-c^2\)，得\(\dfrac34c^2-\dfrac12a^2=0\)，所以\(\dfrac{c^2}{a^2}=\dfrac23\). 由于\(c\)，\(a&gt;0\)，椭圆的离心率为\(e=\dfrac ca=\dfrac{\sqrt6}{3}\).

