sh:
• 由\(b_n\)是\(a_n\)和\(a_{n+1}\)的等比中项，且各项均为正数，得\(b_n^2=a_na_{n+1}\). 所以\[c_n=b_{n+1}^2-b_n^2=a_{n+1}a_{n+2}-a_na_{n+1}
 =a_{n+1}(a_{n+2}-a_n)=2d a_{n+1}\]于是\[c_{n+1}-c_n=2d(a_{n+2}-a_{n+1})=2d^2\]为常数，故数列\(\{c_n\}\)是等差数列.

• 因为\(a_1=d\)，且\(\{a_n\}\)为等差数列，所以\(a_n=nd\). 从而\(b_n^2=a_na_{n+1}=n(n+1)d^2\). 将相邻两项配对，得\[\begin{gathered}
T_n=d^2\sum_{k=1}^{2n}(-1)^k k(k+1)
 =d^2\sum_{j=1}^n\left[-(2j-1)(2j)+(2j)(2j+1)\right]\\
 =d^2\sum_{j=1}^n4j=2d^2n(n+1).
\end{gathered}\]因此\[\sum_{k=1}^n\frac1{T_k}=\frac1{2d^2}\sum_{k=1}^n\frac1{k(k+1)}
 =\frac1{2d^2}\sum_{k=1}^n\left(\frac1k-\frac1{k+1}\right)
 =\frac1{2d^2}\left(1-\frac1{n+1}\right)&lt;\frac1{2d^2}\]

